==================================================
1. THE PRODUCT
==================================================

CivicAI connects citizens, government officers, and field workers through one intelligent civic complaint management platform.

Citizens can report:
- Potholes and damaged roads
- Garbage accumulation and illegal dumping
- Water leakage
- Broken streetlights
- Drainage and sewage issues
- Fallen trees
- Damaged public infrastructure
- Other civic problems

The system analyzes complaints, recommends categories and responsible departments, assigns priority, tracks progress, and provides transparency to citizens.

Primary workflow:

Citizen reports issue
→ AI analyzes the photo and description
→ Issue category and severity are determined
→ Department is recommended
→ Complaint ID is generated
→ Officer reviews the complaint
→ Worker is assigned
→ Worker updates progress
→ Complaint is resolved
→ Citizen receives an update and provides feedback.

This entire workflow must work.

